{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"4c982031ed0bec88","name":"card_event_bpf","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Britain/NavalWarfare/events/card_event_bpf","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"BPF","text":"Develop BLAST, PLAN or PRODUCTION, then Develop a British Navy card.","flavorText":"The British Pacific Fleet (BPF) was a Royal Navy force that fought against Japan during World War II. It was created in November 1944 and included aircraft carriers, warships, submarines, and supply ships from the Royal Navy and other Commonwealth navies. After forming in Ceylon (now Sri Lanka), the fleet first carried out attacks on Japanese resources in Sumatra. It then moved to Australia, setting up its main base in Sydney and a forward base on Manus Island near Papua New Guinea. In March 1945, the BPF supported the invasion of Okinawa by targeting Japanese air bases on the Sakishima Islands. Despite facing strong Japanese air attacks, the fleet’s armored carriers and modern fighter aircraft provided strong defense. Its submarines also played a crucial role in disrupting Japanese supply lines and naval operations. In July 1945, the fleet helped bombard the Japanese mainland. By the war’s end the BPF had four battleships, six fleet carriers, fifteen smaller carriers, and over 750 aircraft.","faction":"Britain","type":"order","rarity":"Unique","cost":2,"operationCost":0,"attack":0,"defense":0},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"GameplayTags":["ability.develop"],"Name":"card_event_bpf","title":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_event_bpf_title","SourceString":"BPF","LocalizedString":"BPF"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::order","faction":"EFactionEnum::Britain","kredits":2,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_event_bpf_text","SourceString":"Develop BLAST, PLAN or PRODUCTION, then Develop a British Navy card.","LocalizedString":"Develop BLAST, PLAN or PRODUCTION, then Develop a British Navy card."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_event_bpf_history","SourceString":"The British Pacific Fleet (BPF) was a Royal Navy force that fought against Japan during World War II. It was created in November 1944 and included aircraft carriers, warships, submarines, and supply ships from the Royal Navy and other Commonwealth navies. After forming in Ceylon (now Sri Lanka), the fleet first carried out attacks on Japanese resources in Sumatra. It then moved to Australia, setting up its main base in Sydney and a forward base on Manus Island near Papua New Guinea. In March 1945, the BPF supported the invasion of Okinawa by targeting Japanese air bases on the Sakishima Islands. Despite facing strong Japanese air attacks, the fleet’s armored carriers and modern fighter aircraft provided strong defense. Its submarines also played a crucial role in disrupting Japanese supply lines and naval operations. In July 1945, the fleet helped bombard the Japanese mainland. By the war’s end the BPF had four battleships, six fleet carriers, fifteen smaller carriers, and over 750 aircraft.","LocalizedString":"The British Pacific Fleet (BPF) was a Royal Navy force that fought against Japan during World War II. It was created in November 1944 and included aircraft carriers, warships, submarines, and supply ships from the Royal Navy and other Commonwealth navies. After forming in Ceylon (now Sri Lanka), the fleet first carried out attacks on Japanese resources in Sumatra. It then moved to Australia, setting up its main base in Sydney and a forward base on Manus Island near Papua New Guinea. In March 1945, the BPF supported the invasion of Okinawa by targeting Japanese air bases on the Sakishima Islands. Despite facing strong Japanese air attacks, the fleet’s armored carriers and modern fighter aircraft provided strong defense. Its submarines also played a crucial role in disrupting Japanese supply lines and naval operations. In July 1945, the fleet helped bombard the Japanese mainland. By the war’s end the BPF had four battleships, six fleet carriers, fifteen smaller carriers, and over 750 aircraft."},"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Unique","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::NavalWarfare","extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Convert"],"spawnCardName":"card_event_blast;card_event_plan;card_event_production","soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'WolfPack_17'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Misc/OrdersFeb17/WolfPack_17.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Britain/NavalWarfare/t_british_pacific_fleet.t_british_pacific_fleet","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Anthony Cowland","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/BPF.BPF","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":370.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_event_bpf_photo","SourceString":"Five of the six fleet aircraft carriers of the British Pacific Fleet in 1945.","LocalizedString":"Five of the six fleet aircraft carriers of the British Pacific Fleet in 1945."}},"variables":[{"name":"PossibleCards","type":"TArray<UBaseCardObject*>","direction":"in"}],"functions":[{"name":"ExecuteUbergraph_card_event_bpf","owner":"card_event_bpf_C","params":[{"name":"EntryPoint","type":"int32","direction":"in"}],"pure":false,"event":false,"flags":"FUNC_Final | FUNC_UbergraphFunction","locals":[{"name":"K2Node_Event_targetCard","type":"UBaseCardObject*","direction":"in"},{"name":"CallFunc_selectCardToDraw_drawnCardID","type":"int32","direction":"in"},{"name":"CallFunc_JSON_GetBool_value","type":"bool","direction":"in"},{"name":"CallFunc_JSON_GetBool_found","type":"bool","direction":"in"},{"name":"CallFunc_JSON_SetBool_found","type":"bool","direction":"in"},{"name":"K2Node_Event_handTargetCardID","type":"int32","direction":"in"},{"name":"K2Node_Event_instigatorID","type":"int32","direction":"in"},{"name":"CallFunc_IsSideActive_active","type":"bool","direction":"in"}],"body":[{"op":"ComputedJump","at":0,"value":{"op":"Variable","name":"EntryPoint","type":"int32","scope":"local